      ],
      "messages": {
        "202300000": {
          "id": 202300000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "How can there be such an adorable creature in this world!?",
          "next": [
            202300001
          ]
        },
        "202300001": {
          "id": 202300001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Its paws are so soft, and it smells like fresh rice!",
          "next": [
            202300002
          ]
        },
        "202300002": {
          "id": 202300002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Too bad my camera's busted, can't snap a pic of this little angelic pup.",
          "next": [
            202300003,
            202300004,
            202300006
          ]
        },
        "202300003": {
          "id": 202300003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Agreed! Puppies make the world a better place!",
          "next": [
            202300008
          ]
        },
        "202300004": {
          "id": 202300004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You got a dog? Can I pet it?",
          "next": [
            202300005
          ]
        },
        "202300005": {
          "id": 202300005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Unfortunately, it's my client's dog.",
          "next": [
            202300008
          ]
        },
        "202300006": {
          "id": 202300006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Sorry, I'm more of a cat person.",
          "next": [
            202300007
          ]
        },
        "202300007": {
          "id": 202300007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Oh, I see.",
          "next": [
            202300008
          ]
        },
        "202300008": {
          "id": 202300008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "An important figure whose identity remains confidential has received a threatening letter from an unknown source this morning.",
          "next": [
            202300009
          ]
        },
        "202300009": {
          "id": 202300009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "It only had four words in it: \"Your days are numbered.\"",
          "next": [
            202300010
          ]
        },
        "202300010": {
          "id": 202300010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "I didn't hesitate for a sec and took the assignment on the spot.",
          "next": [
            202300011
          ]
        },
        "202300011": {
          "id": 202300011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Now nobody dares lay a finger on that pup.",
          "next": [
            202300012
          ]
        },
        "202300012": {
          "id": 202300012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Perhaps the \"you\" mentioned in the letter isn't referring to the dog...?",
          "next": [
            202300013
          ]
        },
        "202300013": {
          "id": 202300013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Oh, you mean the client? Of course I know. Don't worry, Mister N is on the way to protect him.",
          "next": [
            202300014
          ]
        },
        "202300014": {
          "id": 202300014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "The puppy needs me more than my client does.",
          "next": [
            202300015,
            202300016
          ]
        },
        "202300015": {
          "id": 202300015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Looks to me like you're the one who needs it more.",
          "next": [
            202300017
          ]
        },
        "202300016": {
          "id": 202300016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Why don't you just get a dog yourself? Save yourself from mooching off other people all the time.",
          "next": [
            202300017
          ]
        },
        "202300017": {
          "id": 202300017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Hey!!! I'd get my own dog if I could afford dog food...",
          "next": [
            202300018
          ]
        },
        "202300018": {
          "id": 202300018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "My client said dogs are money pits... I can't allow the little one to suffer with me.",
          "next": [
            202300019
          ]
        },
        "202300019": {
          "id": 202300019,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "next": [
            202300020
          ]
        },
        "202300020": {
          "id": 202300020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Wait, something's off.",
          "next": [
            202300021
          ]
        },
        "202300021": {
          "id": 202300021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your friend is typing...",
          "next": [
            202300022
          ]
        },
        "202300022": {
          "id": 202300022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Good dog. Don't bite my wallet, there's nothing in there. You aren't supposed to eat just anything. Woof woof woof woof!",
          "next": [
            202300023
          ]
        },
        "202300023": {
          "id": 202300023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Voice message converted to text",
          "next": [
            202300024
          ]
        },
        "202300024": {
          "id": 202300024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Whoa, what's with the potty mouth? Woof woof woof! You hear me? Puppies shouldn't curse. Woof woof woof woof!",
          "next": [
            202300025
          ]
        },
        "202300025": {
          "id": 202300025,
          "type": "Text",
